rem Martian Factorials
rem https://acmp.ru/index.asp?main=task&id_task=200
rem Number of trailing zeros of N! in base K via prime factorization and Legendre's formula

use numbers
use sequences
use algo
use io
use cli

arg N integer = 5
arg K integer = 10

Factors = K factors array
Primes = Factors unique array

Ks = new queue
for P in Primes
  E = (Factors equal P) count
  Legendre = 0
  X = N // P
  for X greater 0
    Legendre += X
    X //= P
  end
  Ks push (Legendre // E)
end

Answer = (Ks array) min
Answer print
